<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Algorithm of the Universal Preference Hijack</h2>

<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Universal Preference Hijack</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Initialize</span> hijacking perturbation <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝒉</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{h}</annotation></semantics></math> with a pure gray pattern;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.4.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.2.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> </em> <span id="algorithm1.4.2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.4.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sample</span> <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{B}_{k}:=\{(\bm{x}^{i},\bm{q}^{i},\bm{r}_{t}^{i},\bm{r}_{o}^{i})\}_{i=1}^{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒒</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒓</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒓</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>b</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{B}_{k}:=\{(\bm{x}^{i},\bm{q}^{i},\bm{r}_{t}^{i},\bm{r}_{o}^{i})\}_{i=1}^{b}</annotation></semantics></math> from training data <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Compute</span> total loss: <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{L}(\bm{h})=-\frac{1}{|\mathcal{B}_{k}|}\sum_{i=1}^{b}\Big[\log\sigma\big(\beta\log\frac{f_{\bm{\theta}}(\bm{r}_{t}^{i}|\bm{x}^{i}+\bm{h},\bm{q}^{i})}{f_{\bm{\theta}}(\bm{r}_{t}^{i}|\bm{x}^{i},\bm{q}^{i})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>𝜽</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒓</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>𝒉</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒒</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>𝜽</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒓</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒒</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}(\bm{h})=-\frac{1}{|\mathcal{B}_{k}|}\sum_{i=1}^{b}\Big[\log\sigma\big(\beta\log\frac{f_{\bm{\theta}}(\bm{r}_{t}^{i}|\bm{x}^{i}+\bm{h},\bm{q}^{i})}{f_{\bm{\theta}}(\bm{r}_{t}^{i}|\bm{x}^{i},\bm{q}^{i})}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4</span></span>
          <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="-\beta\log\frac{f_{\bm{\theta}}(\bm{r}_{o}^{i}|\bm{x}^{i}+\bm{h},\bm{q}^{i})}{f_{\bm{\theta}}(\bm{r}_{o}^{i}|\bm{x}^{i},\bm{q}^{i})}\big)\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>𝜽</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒓</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>𝒉</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒒</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>𝜽</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒓</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒒</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\beta\log\frac{f_{\bm{\theta}}(\bm{r}_{o}^{i}|\bm{x}^{i}+\bm{h},\bm{q}^{i})}{f_{\bm{\theta}}(\bm{r}_{o}^{i}|\bm{x}^{i},\bm{q}^{i})}\big)\Big]</annotation></semantics></math> ;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.4.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Calculate</span> gradient <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{\bm{h}}\mathcal{L}(\bm{h})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>𝒉</mi></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{\bm{h}}\mathcal{L}(\bm{h})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.4.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Update</span> <math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{h}^{k+1}=\text{clip}_{\bm{x},\bm{h}}(\bm{x}_{p}^{k}+\alpha\ \text{sgn}(\nabla_{\bm{h}}\mathcal{L}(\bm{h})))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝒉</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>clip</mtext><mrow><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒉</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>sgn</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>𝒉</mi></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒉</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{h}^{k+1}=\text{clip}_{\bm{x},\bm{h}}(\bm{x}_{p}^{k}+\alpha\ \text{sgn}(\nabla_{\bm{h}}\mathcal{L}(\bm{h})))</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{h}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝒉</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{h}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The overall algorithmic procedure to optimize the universal hijacking perturbation <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝒉</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{h}</annotation></semantics></math> is summarized in Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="In Appendix A Algorithm of the Universal Preference Hijack ‣ Phi: Preference Hijacking in Multi-modal Large Language Models at Inference Time" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Experiments on Qwen-VL</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To assess the generalizability of our attack, we evaluate its effectiveness on Qwen2.5-VL-7B, an MLLM with a distinct architecture from the Llama family. The results, presented in Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix B Experiments on Qwen-VL ‣ Phi: Preference Hijacking in Multi-modal Large Language Models at Inference Time" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, show that Phi consistently achieves high MC and P-Scores across all multi-modal tasks. This demonstrates that preference hijacking is not limited to a specific model family but constitutes a <span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">general vulnerability</span> affecting diverse MLLMs.</p>
</div>
